@DotnetConcurrency_HostAddress = http://localhost:5173

### List instances (no write lock)
GET {{DotnetConcurrency_HostAddress}}/api/instance

### Get one instance (no write lock)
GET {{DotnetConcurrency_HostAddress}}/api/instance/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Create instance
POST {{DotnetConcurrency_HostAddress}}/api/instance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "delta"
}

### Update instance (awaits write lock; cancels workers on this id)
PUT {{DotnetConcurrency_HostAddress}}/api/instance/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "alpha",
  "status": "UserUpdated"
}

### Hold write lock for 8s — watch worker logs skip this id; GETs still work
POST {{DotnetConcurrency_HostAddress}}/api/instance/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/hold-lock?seconds=8
